      "id": 1,
      "text": "Founded in 1839 as Marine Mills, the town was named after Marine, Illinois.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marine_on_St._Croix%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The site of the first commercial sawmill on the St. Croix dates back to 1839.",
